    "title": "Doctor by day, UFC fighter by night - Chinadaily.com.cn",
    "text": "Shi Ming, a Chinese doctor and UFC fighter, is set to make her Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC) debut on Friday in Shanghai. By day, she is a physician practicing acupuncture at a hospital in Kunming, Yunnan province; by night, she transforms into a fearless fighter stepping into the octagon. The 30-year-old will appear in the special main event of the Road to UFC Season 4 semi-finals before the UFC Fight Night.",
